# the same loop with loop invariants withheld: nothing stands in front of the loop, so the counter is compared with the number in every turn
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Guesses+Folding+UnboxedNumbers
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: isLoopHead=true
# CHECK: = Less {{*}}form=Numbers
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Guesses+Folding+UnboxedNumbers
# NEVER-NOT: IntegerBound
# PROGRAM-OF: number-that-bounds-a-counter-is-rounded-in-front-of-the-loop.ir
